    "media:imagetext": "PITCAIRN\nAIRS\nViews of the complete and modern plant of Pitcairn Air-\ncraft, Inc., at Willow Grove, Pa. At the top is a bird's-eye\nview of the plant. Below at left, a glimpse of work on\nwelded steel tubing, fuselage construction.\nLower right,\nsection of rotor blade and wing construction\nThe organization responsible\nfor the Pitcairn Autogiro . .\nThe Pitcairn Autogiro is made by a company\nwith a long and successful record in the aircraft\nindustry. Beginning with the early Pitcairn\nOrowings, through the Pitcairn Mailwing air-\nmail successes, down to the present Pitcairn\nTandem-all Pitcairn products earned their\nreputation for excellence in design, material and\ncraftsmanship. The Pitcairn plant is manned\nby a personnel experienced in manufacture.\nPITCAIRN AUTOGIRO COMPANY\nPITCAIRN FIELD, WILLOW GROVE, PA.\nS. L. NO. 8\n2012\nPRINTED IN U.S. A",
